  "details": "So when a player joins my world (this happens in any world, just using mine as an example), its verry common that the player will first appear at 0 0 0 instead of one of the spawn points, this includes the new player spawn in effects. It's very irritating as the only option we have is to move the entire world, which we cant easily do :(\n\nPlease fix this.",
